                "event": "Flash Flood Warning",
                "sender": "w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov",
                "senderName": "NWS Des Moines IA",
                "headline": "Flash Flood Warning issued September 9 at 1:49AM CDT until September 9 at 7:45AM CDT by NWS Des Moines IA",
                "description": "FFWDMX\n\nThe National Weather Service in Des Moines has issued a\n\n* Flash Flood Warning for...\nSouthern Dallas County in central Iowa...\nSouthern Polk County in central Iowa...\nNorthern Madison County in south central Iowa...\nNorthern Warren County in south central Iowa...\nNorthern Adair County in southwestern Iowa...\nNorthern Cass County in southwestern Iowa...\nSouthern Audubon County in west central Iowa...\nSouthern Guthrie County in west central Iowa...\n\n* Until 745 AM CDT.\n\n* At 149 AM CDT, Doppler radar indicated thunderstorms producing\nheavy rain across the warned area. Between 2 and 4.5 inches of rain\nhave fallen, with locally higher amounts. Additional rainfall\namounts of 1 to 2 inches are possible in the warned area through\nsunrise. Flash flooding is ongoing or expected to begin shortly.\n\nHAZARD...Flash flooding caused by thunderstorms.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Flash flooding of small creeks and streams, urban areas,\nhighways, streets and underpasses as well as other poor\ndrainage and low-lying areas.\n\n* Some locations that will experience flash flooding include...\nDes Moines, West Des Moines, Ankeny, Urbandale, Johnston, Clive,\nIndianola, Altoona, Waukee, Norwalk, Pleasant Hill, Grimes,\nAtlantic, Adel, Guthrie Center, Windsor Heights, Carlisle,\nBondurant, Saylorville and Mitchellville.",
                "instruction": "Turn around, don't drown when encountering flooded roads. Most flood\ndeaths occur in vehicles.\n\nBe especially cautious at night when it is harder to recognize the\ndangers of flooding.\n\nFor the latest stream observations and forecasts refer to\nweather.gov/desmoines/water.",
                "response": "Avoid",
                "note": null,
